00:14:01.120 --> 00:14:02.910
mmm...

00:14:03.010 --> 00:14:07.010
Stop it, please, stop it...

00:14:07.070 --> 00:14:08.850
mmm....

00:14:08.850 --> 00:14:11.200
It's become a really bad blizzard...

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:13.200
Hope it stops soon...

00:14:14.570 --> 00:14:15.420
Yuuto...

00:14:16.420 --> 00:14:17.450
Nogizaka-san...

00:14:18.630 --> 00:14:20.400
Haruka-sama!

00:14:20.970 --> 00:14:23.220
Haruka-sama!

00:14:28.150 --> 00:14:30.180
Onee-chan, please be safe...

00:14:33.940 --> 00:14:35.140
Haruka!

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:39.940
But, don't you think the blizzard is getting a little better?

00:14:40.020 --> 00:14:41.520
Hazuki-san...hm?

00:14:41.880 --> 00:14:42.660
Hazuki-san!

00:14:43.130 --> 00:14:44.830
Oh no! I lost her!

00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:49.170
Hm?

00:14:50.720 --> 00:14:51.560
Is that...

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:53.240
Haruka!

00:14:55.790 --> 00:14:56.370
Oh...

00:14:56.300 --> 00:14:57.830
Haruka!

00:14:58.320 --> 00:14:59.680
Haruka!

00:14:59.770 --> 00:15:01.800
Ky-Kyaaah!!!

00:15:01.860 --> 00:15:03.890
I-I'm not suspicious!

00:15:03.890 --> 00:15:05.950
I didn't steal any honey or salmon!

00:15:05.950 --> 00:15:07.490
So please don't eat me!

00:15:07.490 --> 00:15:08.600
Kuma-san!!

00:15:08.600 --> 00:15:09.840
No, no!

00:15:10.190 --> 00:15:12.010
Haruka, it's me, me!

00:15:12.260 --> 00:15:13.100
Oh!

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:15.120
Yu-Yuuto-san!

00:15:15.880 --> 00:15:16.470
Oh...

00:15:16.840 --> 00:15:18.850
I'm glad you're okay.

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:20.850
Everyone's really worried.

00:15:21.030 --> 00:15:22.940
Y-yes, I'm sorry...

00:15:23.280 --> 00:15:24.790
Let's go back now!

00:15:25.300 --> 00:15:27.040
It's not safe here.

00:15:28.470 --> 00:15:29.560
I'm sorry...

00:15:29.890 --> 00:15:31.190
I can't go back yet...

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:32.630
Wh-why?

00:15:33.380 --> 00:15:35.160
I've lost something...

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:37.160
it's very precious...

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:39.200
Oh...is it!?

00:15:40.610 --> 00:15:43.960
Ring...the Moonlight...

00:15:44.600 --> 00:15:49.220
I realized after we got back to the lodge that the chain broke and came off...

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:51.910
I found the chain here just now!

00:15:52.120 --> 00:15:54.530
So it has to be somewhere around here!

00:15:54.530 --> 00:15:56.160
There's no time for that!

00:15:56.340 --> 00:15:59.340
It's impossible to find a ring at night in the snow!

00:15:59.480 --> 00:16:02.470
That ring is something that Yuuto-san gave me and is precious!

00:16:02.470 --> 00:16:03.180
So!

00:16:04.320 --> 00:16:06.420
So I have to find it no matter what!

00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:07.340
Haruka!

00:16:07.660 --> 00:16:10.590
I feel so bad for Yuuto-san if I didn't find it...

00:16:10.970 --> 00:16:13.610
It's already awful that I didn't realize it when I dropped it...

00:16:14.640 --> 00:16:15.310
So...

00:16:16.170 --> 00:16:16.860
so!

00:16:18.140 --> 00:16:18.990
Haruka...

00:16:19.520 --> 00:16:20.830
b-but you can't!

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:22.050
If you go on like this..!

00:16:22.050 --> 00:16:23.670
I know it's here somewhere!!

00:16:25.280 --> 00:16:26.480
It has...to be...

00:16:29.110 --> 00:16:30.590
Haruka! That's enough!

00:16:31.440 --> 00:16:32.110
Ah!

00:16:46.090 --> 00:16:48.700
Oh...the moon...light?

00:16:51.290 --> 00:16:52.250
There!

00:16:53.490 --> 00:16:54.750
I found it...

00:16:55.100 --> 00:16:57.380
I will never let it go again...!

00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:01.580
Yuuto-san.

00:17:01.580 --> 00:17:02.410
Haruka!

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:04.730
Oh!

00:17:04.070 --> 00:17:04.700
Huh!?

00:17:05.410 --> 00:17:06.890
Wh-What?

00:17:08.060 --> 00:17:11.100
Ahhh!

00:17:08.060 --> 00:17:11.100
Ahhh!

00:17:18.900 --> 00:17:20.670
Are you okay, Haruka?

00:17:21.030 --> 00:17:22.310
Y-yes!

00:17:23.960 --> 00:17:26.500
Oh man, where are we?

00:17:27.220 --> 00:17:28.930
Yuuto-san, there!

00:17:29.410 --> 00:17:29.810
Hm?

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:36.780
We're okay for now,

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:38.840
but the blizzard's getting worse again...

00:17:41.800 --> 00:17:43.930
I guess we have to wait here till morning...

00:17:44.190 --> 00:17:45.430
Yes...achoo!

00:17:45.890 --> 00:17:47.650
Haruka...are you okay?

00:17:48.230 --> 00:17:51.370
Y-yes, I'm...okay.

00:17:52.480 --> 00:17:54.100
Oh, um...

00:17:59.960 --> 00:18:00.580
Haruka!

00:18:00.730 --> 00:18:01.360
Yes?

00:18:01.460 --> 00:18:02.250
Take off your clothes!

00:18:02.410 --> 00:18:03.410
Y-Yes!

00:18:03.420 --> 00:18:06.000
Uh uh uh uh um! Uh um!

00:18:05.990 --> 00:18:08.390
Is is is is that, um!?

00:18:08.390 --> 00:18:11.490
Um..b-but if Yuuto-san wants me to...

00:18:11.590 --> 00:18:14.610
N-no, uh um! No, no!

00:18:14.950 --> 00:18:18.550
If you stay in those wet clothes, you'll get cold and catch a cold, so!

00:18:19.090 --> 00:18:19.570
Here!

00:18:19.550 --> 00:18:21.120
Instead, here! You can wear this!

00:18:21.250 --> 00:18:23.460
S-sorry, I...!

00:18:24.800 --> 00:18:26.450
Uh...um...

00:18:26.600 --> 00:18:29.200
Then Yuuto-san will get cold, so...

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:30.730
um...

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:33.790
can we be in it together?

00:18:34.080 --> 00:18:34.560
Huh?

00:18:34.970 --> 00:18:40.610
A-at times like this, it's best to warm each other, skin to skin, is what Mika told me before...

00:18:41.560 --> 00:18:44.740
Th-that's true, but...

00:18:45.780 --> 00:18:49.660
I...I'm okay, if it's with Yuuto-san, so...

00:19:06.400 --> 00:19:08.760
Will...will you let me in...?

00:19:24.680 --> 00:19:25.700
Hazuki-san!

00:19:29.070 --> 00:19:31.380
Mika-sama...Akiho-sama...

00:19:31.540 --> 00:19:32.340
Huh...?

00:19:43.830 --> 00:19:45.760
Ha-Haruka...are you okay?

00:19:45.930 --> 00:19:47.080
Y-yes!

00:19:47.510 --> 00:19:50.380
It-it's very...warm...

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:58.550
But...what if...if the blizzard didn't get better at all...

00:19:59.130 --> 00:19:59.880
Haruka...

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:01.450
it'll be okay...

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:02.330
I'm sure...!

00:20:02.830 --> 00:20:06.400
So...if we're able to get back safely, let's go somewhere together, just us.

00:20:06.570 --> 00:20:07.190
Huh?

00:20:07.680 --> 00:20:08.980
I told you before, right?

00:20:09.410 --> 00:20:10.770
Sometime, just us...

00:20:11.490 --> 00:20:13.890
so...it's a promise...

00:20:15.840 --> 00:20:17.090
Y-yes,

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:18.720
it's a promise!

00:20:34.010 --> 00:20:34.990
Oh....

00:20:36.970 --> 00:20:37.900
Haruka...

00:20:49.970 --> 00:20:51.830
Yuuto...san...

00:21:03.360 --> 00:21:04.430
Yuuto-san...

00:21:05.780 --> 00:21:06.290
Oh!?

00:21:09.090 --> 00:21:10.890
Waaah!?

00:21:09.510 --> 00:21:10.890
Haah!?

00:21:12.960 --> 00:21:13.670
Haruka-sama!

00:21:13.670 --> 00:21:14.370
Yuuto-sama!

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:15.020
Are you safe!?

00:21:15.020 --> 00:21:15.940
Eeeehh!?

00:21:16.150 --> 00:21:18.830
Wh-wh-wh-wh-wh-wh-whah...wh-why!?

00:21:19.020 --> 00:21:23.820
What do you mean, why, onii-san, onee-chan, this shack is just right behind the lodge.

00:21:24.130 --> 00:21:24.700
Huh?

00:21:25.780 --> 00:21:27.920
Eeeehhh!?!?

00:21:28.000 --> 00:21:30.510
Douglas-kun has a dispatch signal.

00:21:30.510 --> 00:21:31.390
koku koku

00:21:31.390 --> 00:21:36.320
We saw that the light wasn't even on, so we made our emergency entrance, but...

00:21:36.350 --> 00:21:38.260
Did we interrupt something?

00:21:37.900 --> 00:21:38.490
Uh...

00:21:38.570 --> 00:21:39.320
Oh..

00:21:40.780 --> 00:21:43.540
Oh, Ayase Yuuto!

00:21:43.540 --> 00:21:46.130
I can't! I just can't let you go!

00:21:46.230 --> 00:21:49.540
There's no peace for me until I get rid of....!

00:21:49.820 --> 00:21:50.480
Wah!

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:51.610
Thank you.

00:21:51.780 --> 00:21:52.940
koku koku

00:21:53.460 --> 00:21:55.080
Whoa...

00:21:55.960 --> 00:21:57.080
Well now.

00:21:59.110 --> 00:22:04.480
I'll ask just in case, but...what were you two doing here alone?

00:22:04.850 --> 00:22:06.880
uh..yes...

00:22:07.670 --> 00:22:08.490
Oh...

00:22:14.140 --> 00:22:15.280
It's a secret!

00:22:14.140 --> 00:22:15.280
It's a secret!

00:22:16.910 --> 00:22:17.660
Mm!

00:22:18.280 --> 00:22:20.900
Whoo!

00:22:21.250 --> 00:22:22.930
You've done it!

00:22:22.930 --> 00:22:23.760
koku koku.

00:22:23.750 --> 00:22:24.640
Haruka-sama!

00:22:27.640 --> 00:22:29.660
Eh...Eeh??

00:24:11.590 --> 00:24:14.800
(Nogizaka Haruka no Himitsu Purezza -Fin-)

00:24:14.800 --> 00:24:21.190
(Final episode special project)

00:24:15.790 --> 00:24:17.660
Final episode special project~!

00:24:17.790 --> 00:24:20.170
Onee-chan will show you guys a special imitation!

00:24:20.250 --> 00:24:21.250
First is Nanami-san!

00:24:21.190 --> 00:24:22.980
(Nanashiro Nanami)

00:24:21.300 --> 00:24:22.180
Well, well~

00:24:22.090 --> 00:24:22.960
Next is Alice-chan!

00:24:22.980 --> 00:24:24.560
(Alicetia-Rain)

00:24:23.130 --> 00:24:23.680
koku! koku!

00:24:23.680 --> 00:24:24.720
Next is Mika-chan!

00:24:24.560 --> 00:24:26.860
(Nogizaka Mika)

00:24:24.780 --> 00:24:25.560
Onii-san!

00:24:25.580 --> 00:24:27.190
Last is Nogizaka Gentou-san!

00:24:26.860 --> 00:24:28.980
(Nogizaka Gentou)

00:24:27.240 --> 00:24:29.190
Ayase Yuuto!!

00:24:28.980 --> 00:24:34.740
(See you)

00:24:29.570 --> 00:24:30.990
You're not that good at this...

00:24:31.160 --> 00:24:33.550
I'll practice for next time!

00:24:34.740 --> 00:24:40.400
(Let's see each other again)

00:24:34.740 --> 00:24:40.400
(Nogizaka Haruka no Himitsu Purezza)
